married coming September.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are so excited. We&#039;d like to tie knot in a ceremony on a beautiful sunset at a beach.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are thinking about the right destination.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914471,"PostDate":1466402181,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello all,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are going to get married coming September.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are so excited. We'd like to tie knot in a ceremony on a beautiful sunset at a beach.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are thinking about the right destination.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blueplanet46@outlook.com","IpAddress":"85.203.45.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466401460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287201.jpg?_r=1466416122","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rays123","Id":287201,"Name":"Rays123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80142,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70ae094179ae3e96d7b10d72592844ef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"Rays123\"] !&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;First of all congratulations for your engagement! This must be such an exciting time for you both.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Puerto Vallarta, Mexico is a great destination in Mexico that offers beautiful sunsets and a tranquil mexican town setting that works great for a relaxing time and is becoming trendy for destination weddings.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We invite you to check out our beautiful beach location at the south of the bay of Puerto Vallarta, called Las Caletas.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is a stunning secluted beach accesible only by sea so we are sure it will be a great option for you and your fiancee to share your vows on an intimate and amazing location with the pacific ocean and the Sierra Madre mountains as the backdrop.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you would like to see more information about our packages and available dates please go to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are some pictures so you can check out Las Caletas and wedding setups from past wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best of&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83503]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82974]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83155]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83666]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Best of luck in your search!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914479,"PostDate":1466430949,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287201\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287201-rays123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Rays123<\/span><\/a> !<\/p>\n<p>First of all congratulations for your engagement! This must be such an exciting time for you both.<\/p>\n<p>Puerto Vallarta, Mexico is a great destination in Mexico that offers beautiful sunsets and a tranquil mexican town setting that works great for a relaxing time and is becoming trendy for destination weddings.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We invite you to check out our beautiful beach location at the south of the bay of Puerto Vallarta, called Las Caletas.<\/p>\n<p>This is a stunning secluted beach accesible only by sea so we are sure it will be a great option for you and your fiancee to share your vows on an intimate and amazing location with the pacific ocean and the Sierra Madre mountains as the backdrop.<\/p>\n<p>If you would like to see more information about our packages and available dates please go to:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.adventure...gsvallarta.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Here are some pictures so you can check out Las Caletas and wedding setups from past wedding.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Best of<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83503-destination-wedding-las-caletas-puerto-vallarta\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_1418248.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Destination wedding, Las Caletas Puerto Vallarta'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Destination wedding, Las Caletas Puerto Vallarta' id='sml_image_view_83503' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/82974-renovacion-de-votos\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_29442.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Renovacion De votos'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Renovacion De votos' id='sml_image_view_82974' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83155-lb-by-adventure-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18167\/sml_gallery_258213_18167_558235.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='L&B By Adventure weddings'  width='200' height='132'  alt='L&B By Adventure weddings' id='sml_image_view_83155' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83666-classy-and-beautiful-wedding-dress\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18074\/sml_gallery_258213_18074_4090879.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Classy and beautiful wedding dress'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Classy and beautiful wedding dress' id='sml_image_view_83666' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>Best of luck in your search!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.44.182","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80142,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, Yesterday, 02:03 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1466431408,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9726e2d13fe82a3092f3527c59400c2c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Rays123, welcome to the forum and Congrats on your beautiful beach wedding in Sept!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You&#039;ll find lots of great info to help with your planning questions - so well done on joining up :) We&#039;ve captured many magnificent Mayan Riviera sunsets at the beach that lights our newlyweds in that magical GOLDen light......like these, enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq&#039;&gt;Riviera Maya Resort Wedding Story Albums:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1c8fdc4b237c49529e5aea1f36dbc247.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1c8fdc4b237c49529e5aea1f36dbc247.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1c8fdc4b237c49529e5aea1f36dbc247.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914480,"PostDate":1466431157,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Rays123, welcome to the forum and Congrats on your beautiful beach wedding in Sept!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You'll find lots of great info to help with your planning questions - so well done on joining up <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> We've captured many magnificent Mayan Riviera sunsets at the beach that lights our newlyweds in that magical GOLDen light......like these, enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Riviera Maya Resort Wedding Story Albums:<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1c8fdc4b237c49529e5aea1f36dbc247.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1c8fdc4b237c49529e5aea1f36dbc247.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1c8fdc4b237c49529e5aea1f36dbc247.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_d34698538c624bc09ebd3e4f999a77af.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1048ba96f8454c57a39c3c490308a972.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.19.252.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80142,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"329192b71c9882fcc974f3a3a4e85b1c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow, thanks. I liked those places very much, like straight out of my dream.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914483,"PostDate":1466475150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow, thanks. I liked those places very much, like straight out of my dream.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"blueplanet46@outlook.com","IpAddress":"85.203.45.28","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466401460,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287201.jpg?_r=1466416122","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":140,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Rays123","Id":287201,"Name":"Rays123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"116.58.205.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80142,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12d93f6fa279c5ca7e2f3261ab76a7d1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome into this forum. Myself newbie too. Enjoy your stay here.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914488,"PostDate":1466493256,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome into this forum. Myself newbie too. Enjoy your stay here.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"f.dernando@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"116.58.200.42","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1466287501,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kellian","Id":287193,"Name":"Kellian","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80142","Title":"Greeting Everyone.","LastPostDate":1466493256},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
