{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":8,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":426,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914310,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287124,"Name":"laaron09","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1465560983,"LastPoster":{"Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1466510964","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1914310,"PostDate":1465560983,"PostContent":"Hello everyone! \u00a0 My name is LaTayia but I go by Tia. My fiance and I were recently engaged on Ma...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmacdb15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.26.28.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465559895,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"laaron09","Id":287124,"Name":"laaron09","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.26.28.8","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80129,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dc6ad6029fabd8b47f19e736113013ca","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello everyone!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My name is LaTayia but I go by Tia. My fiance and I were recently engaged on May 22nd. We are extremely interested in a destination wedding and have decided to have it in Playa Del Carmen, Mexico. We took our first international trip together there and thought it would be really nice to go back to where we started. Currently I am interested in having it at Paradisus Playa Del Carmen because that is where we stayed our first trip and since we have young children coming I felt it would be the best option since there is an adults only and a family side.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;After looking at the website the tailor made option seems to be the best fit for us. We plan to get married June 2, 2018 so I know it&#039;s a little early to actually book everything but I would definitely love any advice you all are able to offer. There will be about 40 or so people in attendance.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have a few questions that hopefully someone may be able to address:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1) When it comes to booking the resort for a wedding, do you have to pay a down payment or do you pay in full?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2) How does making room reservations work? Each couple that will be coming will be paying for their own rooms so do we just tell the hotel how many rooms we will need and then the block them out? Or do my fiance and I have to make a payment to reserve the rooms?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3) If in the event that it rains, where do they have the ceremonies?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4) Is there anything that we are not permitted to bring to the resort? Such as a unity candle or remembrance candles for loved ones who are no longer with us? A related question is, has anyone packed the knives to cut the cake with in their luggage?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5) Can anyone offer any information about how much each package costs? I know I can call the resort and ask but I am curious to know the range in which others have paid.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;6) Does the DJ that is recommended by the resort play all types of music\/can you request him to play certain songs?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;7) For those who have had their hair and makeup done at the spa, how did you like it? Do they specialize in all hair types and complexions?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;8) If anyone could give their experiences on the ease or trouble they went through when planning their wedding at this resort went that would be great!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I know I have asked a lot of questions here but I am just really excited! lol&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you in advance for all of your help :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914310,"PostDate":1465560983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello everyone!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My name is LaTayia but I go by Tia. My fiance and I were recently engaged on May 22nd. We are extremely interested in a destination wedding and have decided to have it in Playa Del Carmen, Mexico. We took our first international trip together there and thought it would be really nice to go back to where we started. Currently I am interested in having it at Paradisus Playa Del Carmen because that is where we stayed our first trip and since we have young children coming I felt it would be the best option since there is an adults only and a family side.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>After looking at the website the tailor made option seems to be the best fit for us. We plan to get married June 2, 2018 so I know it's a little early to actually book everything but I would definitely love any advice you all are able to offer. There will be about 40 or so people in attendance.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have a few questions that hopefully someone may be able to address:<\/p>\n<p>1) When it comes to booking the resort for a wedding, do you have to pay a down payment or do you pay in full?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2) How does making room reservations work? Each couple that will be coming will be paying for their own rooms so do we just tell the hotel how many rooms we will need and then the block them out? Or do my fiance and I have to make a payment to reserve the rooms?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3) If in the event that it rains, where do they have the ceremonies?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4) Is there anything that we are not permitted to bring to the resort? Such as a unity candle or remembrance candles for loved ones who are no longer with us? A related question is, has anyone packed the knives to cut the cake with in their luggage?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5) Can anyone offer any information about how much each package costs? I know I can call the resort and ask but I am curious to know the range in which others have paid.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>6) Does the DJ that is recommended by the resort play all types of music\/can you request him to play certain songs?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>7) For those who have had their hair and makeup done at the spa, how did you like it? Do they specialize in all hair types and complexions?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>8) If anyone could give their experiences on the ease or trouble they went through when planning their wedding at this resort went that would be great!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I know I have asked a lot of questions here but I am just really excited! lol<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you in advance for all of your help <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmacdb15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.26.28.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465559895,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"laaron09","Id":287124,"Name":"laaron09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.105.16","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80129,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f167366469d67c90ee81296293e25010","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hola @[member=\"laaron09\"] and welcome to the amazing Best Destination Wedding community.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are so many wonderful members and resources here, even though we may not have the answers you are looking for, someone on her certainly will.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;In the meantime we&#039;ll leave you with some inspiration from Noreen &amp;amp; Karim&#039;s beautiful wedding at Paradisus a few months ago.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers! &amp;lt;3&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":35943,"Name":"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_06.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-96179400-1465577044.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-96179400-1465577044_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":35951,"Name":"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_21.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-51688800-1465577224.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-51688800-1465577224_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":668},{"Id":35946,"Name":"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_09.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-01243100-1465577106.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-01243100-1465577106_thumb.jpg","Width":801,"Height":1200},{"Id":35947,"Name":"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_10.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-96634600-1465577130.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-96634600-1465577130_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":666},{"Id":35950,"Name":"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_19.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-14315100-1465577195.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-14315100-1465577195_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":666},{"Id":35952,"Name":"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_07.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-99444100-1465577246.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-99444100-1465577246_thumb.jpg","Width":1000,"Height":666}],"Id":1914311,"PostDate":1465562885,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hola @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287124\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287124-laaron09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">laaron09<\/span><\/a> and welcome to the amazing Best Destination Wedding community.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There are so many wonderful members and resources here, even though we may not have the answers you are looking for, someone on her certainly will.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>In the meantime we'll leave you with some inspiration from Noreen & Karim's beautiful wedding at Paradisus a few months ago.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers! <3<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914311]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-55314600-1465577025.jpg\" title=\"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_05.jpg - Size: 118.81KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-55314600-1465577025.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_05.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914311]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-87528100-1465577147.jpg\" title=\"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_15.jpg - Size: 98.86KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-87528100-1465577147.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_15.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914311]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-54276500-1465577170.jpg\" title=\"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_17.jpg - Size: 86.92KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-54276500-1465577170.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_17.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<a class='resized_img' rel='lightbox[1914311]' id='ipb-attach-url-' href=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-15556000-1465577086.jpg\" title=\"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_08.jpg - Size: 154.85KB\"><img itemprop=\"image\" src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_06_2016\/post-287055-0-15556000-1465577086.jpg\" class='bbc_img linked-image' alt=\"Noreen_Karim_Day2_Teaser_08.jpg\" \/><\/a>\n\n<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/05\/jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\" alt=\"jasminandmattidomexicosignature.png\"><\/p>\n<p><strong>Website:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com\/'>http:\/\/www.jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Email:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:info@jasminandmatt.com'>info@jasminandmatt.com<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Phone:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\">+52 984-114-3386<\/span><br><strong>Facebook:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/jasminandmatt\/'>Jasmin & Matt Photography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Instagram:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/jasminandmattphotography\/'>@jasminandmattphotography<\/a><\/span><br><strong>Pinterest:<\/strong>\u00a0<span style=\"color:rgb(240,128,128);font-size:14px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.pinterest.com\/jasminandmatt'>Jasmin & Matt<\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"forward@jasminandmatt.com","IpAddress":"187.153.21.84","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1464781539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287055.jpg?_r=1464796174","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JasminMattPhoto","Id":287055,"Name":"JasminMattPhoto","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.66.4.22","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80129,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 10 June 2016 - 03:31 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1465572672,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67a899f1914b5c30694b9a07ddc4788e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow! Congrats on your recent engagement in May Tia, and Welcome to our wonderful forum community!!! What an exciting time in your life journey - for sure :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;A great place to start your destination wedding planning is with a TA who can help you narrow down your resort choices with info and options. You&#039;re sure to find loads of helpful resources here to answer all your questions.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....to show you what your photo backdrops will look like at the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq\/tag\/Paradisus-Playa-del-Carmen-Wedding&#039;&gt;Paradisus Playa del Carmen,&lt;\/a&gt; here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured there.....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_45d3106dd9a740fbbc3a031208668770.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_45d3106dd9a740fbbc3a031208668770.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_45d3106dd9a740fbbc3a031208668770.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_940a0ce7da9f401581e0d2cf24c1c2a3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_940a0ce7da9f401581e0d2cf24c1c2a3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_940a0ce7da9f401581e0d2cf24c1c2a3.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_46b0e3015a7d4a8b905c6544f533867d.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_46b0e3015a7d4a8b905c6544f533867d.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_46b0e3015a7d4a8b905c6544f533867d.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914312,"PostDate":1465572498,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow! Congrats on your recent engagement in May Tia, and Welcome to our wonderful forum community!!! What an exciting time in your life journey - for sure <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>A great place to start your destination wedding planning is with a TA who can help you narrow down your resort choices with info and options. You're sure to find loads of helpful resources here to answer all your questions.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!!<\/p>\n<p>Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....to show you what your photo backdrops will look like at the <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!riviera-maya-resorts\/lwgjq\/tag\/Paradisus-Playa-del-Carmen-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Paradisus Playa del Carmen,<\/a> here are some magical wedding moments that matter we captured there.....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_45d3106dd9a740fbbc3a031208668770.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_45d3106dd9a740fbbc3a031208668770.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_45d3106dd9a740fbbc3a031208668770.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_940a0ce7da9f401581e0d2cf24c1c2a3.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_940a0ce7da9f401581e0d2cf24c1c2a3.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_940a0ce7da9f401581e0d2cf24c1c2a3.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_46b0e3015a7d4a8b905c6544f533867d.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_46b0e3015a7d4a8b905c6544f533867d.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_46b0e3015a7d4a8b905c6544f533867d.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280196260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.38.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80129,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d29355443faee7a7c991f86dad18662a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"laaron09\"] Congrats on narrowing down to this beautiful resorts, its never too early to start planning a destination wedding, your guests will thank you for it , since this gives them enough notice.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me get to your questions.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1. Its always a deposit. &amp;nbsp;I guess you are referring to the wedding package. The rest of the wedding fees are paid 3months prior.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;2. When it comes to the room reservation. &amp;nbsp;I always advice you go with a Travel Agent. &amp;nbsp;if you can find one that dedicates themselves to destination weddings even better. &amp;nbsp;this will allow you to only worry about the actual wedding planning and leave the accommodation part to a TA. &amp;nbsp;each and every guests would need to put down their own room reservation. But you would need to do the room block first .&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;3. &amp;nbsp;In case of rain both ceremony and reception are in their ballrooms.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;4. You are more than welcome to bring all the personal touches, no issue at all.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;5. they packages change each year. I know they have 3 packages. in the past have always used their tailor made it offers a lot of things&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;6. Yes the DJ sends out a format you can suggest all your music no problem.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;7. my last client who got married there was african america so they did everything for her.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You have nothing to worry about the food is excellent , the hotel is modern and still looks new. &amp;nbsp;you will have a good time.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here is the link to the wedding we did last August.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2016\/01\/14\/lori-and-rodney-paradisus-resort-riviera-maya-mexico\/&#039;&gt;https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2016\/01\/14\/lori-and-rodney-paradisus-resort-riviera-maya-mexico\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Feel to ask away, I was just there last week with a different bride for 2017.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Joyce&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914314,"PostDate":1465580155,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287124\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287124-laaron09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">laaron09<\/span><\/a> Congrats on narrowing down to this beautiful resorts, its never too early to start planning a destination wedding, your guests will thank you for it , since this gives them enough notice.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me get to your questions.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>1. Its always a deposit. \u00a0I guess you are referring to the wedding package. The rest of the wedding fees are paid 3months prior.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>2. When it comes to the room reservation. \u00a0I always advice you go with a Travel Agent. \u00a0if you can find one that dedicates themselves to destination weddings even better. \u00a0this will allow you to only worry about the actual wedding planning and leave the accommodation part to a TA. \u00a0each and every guests would need to put down their own room reservation. But you would need to do the room block first .\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>3. \u00a0In case of rain both ceremony and reception are in their ballrooms.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>4. You are more than welcome to bring all the personal touches, no issue at all.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>5. they packages change each year. I know they have 3 packages. in the past have always used their tailor made it offers a lot of things<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>6. Yes the DJ sends out a format you can suggest all your music no problem.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>7. my last client who got married there was african america so they did everything for her.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You have nothing to worry about the food is excellent , the hotel is modern and still looks new. \u00a0you will have a good time.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here is the link to the wedding we did last August.<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/dreamweddingsrivieramayablogdotcom.wordpress.com\/2016\/01\/14\/lori-and-rodney-paradisus-resort-riviera-maya-mexico\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/dreamwedding...ra-maya-mexico\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Feel to ask away, I was just there last week with a different bride for 2017.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.42.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80129,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd274c346783ca99efe57031fb1b2eb8","RawContent":"&lt;div&gt;Hi @[member=\"laaron09\"] ! Welcome to the BDW forum community and congrats on your upcoming wedding in Playa del Carmen ! You can find loads of info here and I hope I can help you with question #7 on your list about makeup as we specialize in airbrush makeup in tropical climates like the Riviera Maya, Mexico, and have experience with all sorts of skin types.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Perhaps our blog on airbrush makeup will be helpful:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;You can also learn more about us and see photos of our work here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80078-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80078-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;If interested in more info, don&#039;t hesitate to contact us in this forum or via email at sales@stylingtrio.com. Thanks @[member=\"laaron09\"] and happy destination wedding planning!&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914317,"PostDate":1465584254,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287124\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287124-laaron09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">laaron09<\/span><\/a> ! Welcome to the BDW forum community and congrats on your upcoming wedding in Playa del Carmen ! You can find loads of info here and I hope I can help you with question #7 on your list about makeup as we specialize in airbrush makeup in tropical climates like the Riviera Maya, Mexico, and have experience with all sorts of skin types.\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Perhaps our blog on airbrush makeup will be helpful:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/wedding-tips\/c\/planning\/q-a-is-airbrush-makeup-ideal-in-a-tropic-r2326' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...-a-tropic-r2326<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>You can also learn more about us and see photos of our work here: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/80078-styling-trio-riviera-maya\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...o-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>If interested in more info, don't hesitate to contact us in this forum or via email at sales@stylingtrio.com. Thanks @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287124\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287124-laaron09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">laaron09<\/span><\/a> and happy destination wedding planning!<\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Dena DaSilva<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Online Concierge<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">US (+1) 713 589 4558<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">MX (+52) 984 803 2816<br>\nconcierge@stylingtrio.com<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Facebook: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">facebook\/stylingtrio.com<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Twitter:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Instagram:<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(238,130,238);\">\u00a0<\/span><span style=\"color:rgb(255,153,204);\">@stylingtrio<\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);\">Pinterest: <\/span><span style=\"color:#ff99cc;\">www.pinterest.com\/stylingtrio<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:'Helvetica Neue', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\"><img src=\"https:\/\/ci4.googleusercontent.com\/proxy\/hapv1CMGpXYv2FEz6ZYtPWd2Y_yEKx8fi8QHoF6qa6giBtQe5Sq7Qu37JOO6-9XwSHFc1cI6Ke5Y2N3x9Ue9=s0-d-e1-ft#http:\/\/stylingtrio.com\/Firmas\/Styling.jpg\" alt=\"Styling.jpg\"><\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:rgb(90,90,90);\">\u00a0","Email":"social@stylingtrio.com","IpAddress":"189.221.40.208","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1462465132,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286883.jpg?_r=1463007029","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","Id":286883,"Name":"StylingTrioRivieraMaya","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.129.163.14","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80129,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ea707f2088e848d1a035b197d36aaac","RawContent":"Thank you to everyone for your feed. \n\n\n@[member=\"dreamweddings\"] thank you so much for answering my questions! I do have a few more questions though as I am new to all of this. I know I have time to actually get everything set up considering it&#039;s not until 2018 but how soon should I contact the resort? Also may you tell me how blocking rooms work? Will we have to pay anything for have them do a room block?\n\n\nI have been to this resort once before and I am excited to return. The rooms were gorgeous. I just want to be prepared so when I&#039;m ready to make the call I can know what to expect. \n\n\nAgain, thank you for answering my questions!","Attachments":[],"Id":1914325,"PostDate":1465675034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you to everyone for your feed. <br><br>\n@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a> thank you so much for answering my questions! I do have a few more questions though as I am new to all of this. I know I have time to actually get everything set up considering it's not until 2018 but how soon should I contact the resort? Also may you tell me how blocking rooms work? Will we have to pay anything for have them do a room block?<br><br>\nI have been to this resort once before and I am excited to return. The rooms were gorgeous. I just want to be prepared so when I'm ready to make the call I can know what to expect. <br><br>\nAgain, thank you for answering my questions!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmacdb15@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.26.28.8","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1465559895,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"laaron09","Id":287124,"Name":"laaron09","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.38.183","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80129,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e46dad0b4e95c807342714313add20e8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"laaron09\"] &amp;nbsp;you are right you have plenty of time. &amp;nbsp;I would contact the resort now, so they can send you all the information. Especially if you are planning on giving your guests enough time to save up for the trip.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;about the room block. &amp;nbsp;I would ask any TA since they have the right information to answer this part. have you reached out to any of them yet?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;HappyPlanning&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Joyce&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914352,"PostDate":1465814376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287124\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287124-laaron09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">laaron09<\/span><\/a> \u00a0you are right you have plenty of time. \u00a0I would contact the resort now, so they can send you all the information. Especially if you are planning on giving your guests enough time to save up for the trip.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>about the room block. \u00a0I would ask any TA since they have the right information to answer this part. have you reached out to any of them yet?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>HappyPlanning<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.149.98.29","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80129,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df79e7d46b7112abfa4f6565e62e470d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi @[member=\"laaron09\"], Congrats!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You will love Playa del Carmen, feel free to take a look to our work =)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18197]&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914415,"PostDate":1466084764,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287124\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287124-laaron09\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">laaron09<\/span><\/a>, Congrats!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You will love Playa del Carmen, feel free to take a look to our work =)<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18197-underwater\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18197\/tn_gallery_287113_18197_3480365.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='CTTD03'  width='75' height='75'  alt='CTTD03' id='tn_image_view_83586_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18197-underwater\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: UnderWater<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>4 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span>Saludos<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span><b>Virginia Hermosillo<\/b><\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Dream Art \u00a0Wedding Photography<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span><span>contact<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:vhermosillo@dreamartphotography.com'>@dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>Tel: +(52) 998 246-5657<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com'>http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src=\"http:\/\/weddings.dreamartphotography.com\/images\/wedding-logo-moto.png\" alt=\"wedding-logo-moto.png\"><\/p>\n<p><span>\u00a0<\/span>","Email":"contact@dreamartphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.43.89","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1465480401,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287113.jpg?_r=1466510964","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"DreamArtPhotography","Id":287113,"Name":"DreamArtPhotography","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80129","Title":"Newly Engaged :)","LastPostDate":1466084764},"Pages":{"TotalItems":8,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
