{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":12,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":581,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1914076,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":287040,"Name":"bmillerick","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287040.jpg?_r=1465126901","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1464613053,"LastPoster":{"Id":286686,"Name":"MeredithLynne","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1914291,"PostDate":1465475065,"PostContent":"This is excellent advice. You must do what you want. People will surprise you with who is willin...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mldiehl1215@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.6.210.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460223892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MeredithLynne","Id":286686,"Name":"MeredithLynne","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.238.208.248","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2bd86f403d107fe2e11c63e163b71062","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"vancouverpetunia\"] thanks! Also, obsessed with your planning thread!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914252,"PostDate":1465332017,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281283\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281283-vancouverpetunia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">vancouverpetunia<\/span><\/a> thanks! Also, obsessed with your planning thread!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmillerick@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.153.133.73","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1464609188,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287040.jpg?_r=1465126901","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmillerick","Id":287040,"Name":"bmillerick","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.232.223.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80111,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"13e8da3a9cd9d4454ad6a7af3b023368","RawContent":"[quote name=\"vancouverpetunia\" post=\"1914236\" timestamp=\"1465323745\"]\n@[member=\"bmillerick\"] That&#039;s hard to answer for you, as only you know your guests, their likes\/dislikes (in terms of what they would want in a resort) and your best guess at what they can afford.\n\nI think what you will find is that you will be surprised at who comes and who doesn&#039;t, and what reasons they each have for their decisions. A lot of the time it is not related to money and, when it is, some of the people you least expected to make it work will be there, while the opposite will also hold true. Advice I&#039;ve seen here many times is be reasonable with your choices, but remember it&#039;s your wedding and you can&#039;t plan it around other people. You may end up disappointed if you do.[\/quote]This is excellent advice. You must do what you want. People will surprise you with who is willing to go and who isn&#039;t. You just have to do what you want and be ready for what comes.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914291,"PostDate":1465475065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>vancouverpetunia, on 07 June 2016 - 02:22 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287040\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/287040-bmillerick\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">bmillerick<\/span><\/a> That's hard to answer for you, as only you know your guests, their likes\/dislikes (in terms of what they would want in a resort) and your best guess at what they can afford.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think what you will find is that you will be surprised at who comes and who doesn't, and what reasons they each have for their decisions. A lot of the time it is not related to money and, when it is, some of the people you least expected to make it work will be there, while the opposite will also hold true. Advice I've seen here many times is be reasonable with your choices, but remember it's your wedding and you can't plan it around other people. You may end up disappointed if you do.\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>This is excellent advice. You must do what you want. People will surprise you with who is willing to go and who isn't. You just have to do what you want and be ready for what comes.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mldiehl1215@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.6.210.243","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1460223892,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"MeredithLynne","Id":286686,"Name":"MeredithLynne","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"80111","Title":"Hello! And Help!","LastPostDate":1465475065},"Pages":{"TotalItems":12,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
