{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":69029,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bda79e1a826b424418d0c65bedb46b44","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;Hi everybody!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;My name is Alessandro Banchelli, I am an Italian professional photographer and have been in the field for the past 11 wonderful years. Have high experience in weddings in Europe and Mexico.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;Many years ago I have started a new Wedding photo agency in Playa del carmen PhotostudioAB, and there i have built a new life with my wife. I enjoy to share my passion for the Photography with my clients because they give to me the chance to live a a dream, photographer in the Mexican Caribbean, I am grateful to them.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;We love to live with our clients the emotions of the wedding day and to built every time a new history.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;I am confident that your album will become a family treasure that you will view again and again. I look forward to discuss your needs and to allow you to view my work of art. After all, when the cake is eaten and the honeymoon is over, your love and professional photographs are all that remains to remind you of YOUR special day. I guarantee you I will work very hard to create images that capture all the emotions &amp;amp; memories of that special day!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;Our wedding services is based on a combination of complementary photographic styles: Traditional, Fashion, Photojournalist, fun and &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"background-color: white; \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;spontaneous.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;I guarantee you knowledge and experience and a personality that matches your desires. For your convenience, I encourage you to visit my web site and my blog to view my unique approach of capturing your memories. The address is &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.photostudioab.com\"&gt;www.photostudioab.com&lt;\/a&gt; or contact me at &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"mailto:ideafotoplaya@gmail.com\"&gt;ideafotoplaya@gmail.com&lt;\/a&gt;.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;We offer our service in : Cancun, Puerto Morelos, Playa del Carmen, Puerto Aventura, Akumal, Tulum, Cozumel, Isla Mujeres, Holbox.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; \n &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;Best regards&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"text-align: center; \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:18px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: times; \"&gt;Alessandro Banchelli&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1652602,"PostDate":1344955532,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">Hi everybody!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">My name is Alessandro Banchelli, I am an Italian professional photographer and have been in the field for the past 11 wonderful years. Have high experience in weddings in Europe and Mexico.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">Many years ago I have started a new Wedding photo agency in Playa del carmen PhotostudioAB, and there i have built a new life with my wife. I enjoy to share my passion for the Photography with my clients because they give to me the chance to live a a dream, photographer in the Mexican Caribbean, I am grateful to them.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">We love to live with our clients the emotions of the wedding day and to built every time a new history.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">I am confident that your album will become a family treasure that you will view again and again. I look forward to discuss your needs and to allow you to view my work of art. After all, when the cake is eaten and the honeymoon is over, your love and professional photographs are all that remains to remind you of YOUR special day. I guarantee you I will work very hard to create images that capture all the emotions & memories of that special day!<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">Our wedding services is based on a combination of complementary photographic styles: Traditional, Fashion, Photojournalist, fun and <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"background-color: white\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">spontaneous.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">I guarantee you knowledge and experience and a personality that matches your desires. For your convenience, I encourage you to visit my web site and my blog to view my unique approach of capturing your memories. The address is <a href='http:\/\/www.photostudioab.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.photostudioab.com<\/a> or contact me at <a href='mailto:ideafotoplaya@gmail.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>ideafotoplaya@gmail.com<\/a>.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">We offer our service in : Cancun, Puerto Morelos, Playa del Carmen, Puerto Aventura, Akumal, Tulum, Cozumel, Isla Mujeres, Holbox.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <br \/> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">Best regards<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> <span  style=\"font-size:18px\"><span  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24)\"><span  style=\"font-family: times\">Alessandro Banchelli<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Ideafotoplaya@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321460738,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"PhotostudioAB","Id":247746,"Name":"PhotostudioAB","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
